{
  "name": "Budget Actions",
  "description": "What will be done for a cost center that is heading over budget or whose forecast is stale: the cause, the plan, an owner and a date.",
  "position": 2,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "propose-action",
      "label": {
        "en": "Propose an action for a cost center heading over budget",
        "zh-CN": "为一个预计超支的部门提出措施"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-budget` skill in this folder and follow it. For the cost center I name, read its signals and score, explain in two or three sentences what is wrong, and add one action with a concrete plan, an owner and a due date. The owner is the person who can fix it — the budget owner or the finance partner.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-budget` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的部门，读它的信号和评分，用两三句话说明问题在哪，然后加一条措施，写清具体计划、负责人和截止日期。负责人是能解决问题的人——预算负责人或财务 BP。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "chase-actions",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which budget actions are overdue?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些预算措施已经超期"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-budget` skill in this folder and follow it. List open actions past their due date with their owner and cost center, and say whether that cost center’s score has moved since the action was opened. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-budget` Skill，按它的规则做。列出超过截止日期仍未完成的措施、负责人和对应部门，并说明措施开出以后这个部门的评分有没有变化。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
